{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415280/extras/dd065eb67b93477107dfae7977d09f5d.avif?t=1753371008\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415280/extras_big/dd065eb67b93477107dfae7977d09f5d.avif?t=1753371008 width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415280/extras/45a069d34cfe4a7da7ac0234b431d68d.avif?t=1753371008\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415280/extras_big/45a069d34cfe4a7da7ac0234b431d68d.avif?t=1753371008 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a single player action adventure game that includes mythological themed character actions and role-playing,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use regular attacks and skills, spells, such as magic, celestial phenomena, and body fixing spells, to</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight and defeat the enemies you encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[h2] Gameplay Introduction [/h2]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Basic operation: Use the keyboard and mouse (gamepad) to control the player's hero, embark on a game journey, and control the player</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move, jump, change of perspective, attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Spell skill release: Use the keyboard (gamepad) to specify keys to release skills and spells, such as clone summoning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clone attacks on enemies, use body fixing techniques to control enemy behavior, and use the magic of celestial phenomena and earth skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to increase the player's character's attack by doubling their own size Power effect, instant movement skill to evade enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Upgrade System: Eliminate a specified number of enemies, which can increase the player's hero level, health, attack power, and spells</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill effect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Enemy AI: Intelligent enemy AI enables enemies to have intelligent jumping, healing, and other AI functions, providing a superior gaming </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[h2] Excellent graphics [/2]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed using UE5, making the characters and game scenes incredibly realistic, achieving advanced game graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[h2] Hero Skills [/2]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different spell skills to match game characters and achieve different gaming experiences.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3415280?t=1753371008","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415280/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753371008","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415280/2e0249d13b42090ce4f8b66ad0e321d4f66518fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753371008","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415280/2e0249d13b42090ce4f8b66ad0e321d4f66518fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753371008","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Includes Source SDK","id":16},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415280/extras/dd065eb67b93477107dfae7977d09f5d.avif?t=1753371008\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415280/extras_big/dd065eb67b93477107dfae7977d09f5d.avif?t=1753371008 width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415280/extras/45a069d34cfe4a7da7ac0234b431d68d.avif?t=1753371008\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415280/extras_big/45a069d34cfe4a7da7ac0234b431d68d.avif?t=1753371008 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a single player action adventure game that includes mythological themed character actions and role-playing,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use regular attacks and skills, spells, such as magic, celestial phenomena, and body fixing spells, to</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight and defeat the enemies you encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[h2] Gameplay Introduction [/h2]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Basic operation: Use the keyboard and mouse (gamepad) to control the player's hero, embark on a game journey, and control the player</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move, jump, change of perspective, attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Spell skill release: Use the keyboard (gamepad) to specify keys to release skills and spells, such as clone summoning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clone attacks on enemies, use body fixing techniques to control enemy behavior, and use the magic of celestial phenomena and earth skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to increase the player's character's attack by doubling their own size Power effect, instant movement skill to evade enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Upgrade System: Eliminate a specified number of enemies, which can increase the player's hero level, health, attack power, and spells</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill effect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Enemy AI: Intelligent enemy AI enables enemies to have intelligent jumping, healing, and other AI functions, providing a superior gaming </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[h2] Excellent graphics [/2]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed using UE5, making the characters and game scenes incredibly realistic, achieving advanced game graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[h2] Hero Skills [/2]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different spell skills to match game characters and achieve different gaming experiences.</p>","developers":["\u5723\u5de5\u4f5c\u5ba4"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415280/header.jpg?t=1753371008","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3415280/830004/e213ecbf4d418582bdbbddfbc05b62a5fd25523a/1750848790/dash_av1.mpd?t=1740323158","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3415280/830004/e213ecbf4d418582bdbbddfbc05b62a5fd25523a/1750848790/dash_h264.mpd?t=1740323158","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3415280/830004/e213ecbf4d418582bdbbddfbc05b62a5fd25523a/1750848790/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1740323158","id":257099015,"name":"\u65e0\u53cc","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257099015/8e2d752ea27d226fcd302cd2b78cf340ddafd405/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740323158"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3415280/804936/8c2c55ce1eae4b8994bc74ad3b55d87cfaf7ea25/1750848786/dash_av1.mpd?t=1740323160","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3415280/804936/8c2c5